    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 4419c67919ce44758e505c0b88fc59c7
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A curser (witch, hex-caster, field engineer — any faction): the moment it can see you with its signature ready (EnemyData › Kit › Signature: a Rift, a Snare…) it lays it on you, then vanishes with its escape (Kit › Escape: a Phase Shift, an Ambush…) or behind cover; otherwise it strikes from hiding (Peekaboo).'
